WEBVTT

00:04:00.027 --> 00:04:03.281
So I want to say

00:04:03.281 --> 00:04:08.160
that this is a moment
when we have to rise to this occasion.

00:04:08.953 --> 00:04:14.041
Abraham Lincoln said the occasion
is piled with difficulty,

00:04:14.083 --> 00:04:15.418
piled high with difficulty,

00:04:15.459 --> 00:04:18.254
and we have to rise with the occasion.

00:04:18.254 --> 00:04:21.966
As our case is new,
we must think anew and act anew.

00:04:22.008 --> 00:04:26.012
We have to find ways
to solve the democracy crisis

00:04:26.053 --> 00:04:28.514
in order to solve the climate crisis.

00:04:28.514 --> 00:04:35.021
(Applause)